// transientYieldIndexParkingBand / 2: does the parking lot know the flow index?
//
// 5.56 swept a Bingham node's own start across its band and found the tail to be
// quadratic in the excess -- `1 - 4x/3 + x^4/3` loses BOTH its constant and its
// linear term at x = 1 -- which is why `1/gap` is a straight line. That
// cancellation is a property of the exponent, not of the dead band, so the
// question this file asks is which half of 5.56 survives when the wall law is
// Herschel-Bulkley, `tau = tau_0 + K gammas^n`:
//
//   * the THRESHOLD is geometry only (`4 tau_0 L / d`, no `n`, no `K`), so the
//     band should be the SAME [pA - 8000, pB + 8000] = [22000, 28000] Pa for
//     every index, and the two edge arms should still be held by `<=`;
//   * the TAIL should change. The HB section integral near threshold is
//     Q = (pi R^3 / (tau_0 K^(1/n))) (n/(n+1)) (d/4L)^m gap^m with m = (n+1)/n,
//     so the excess decays with exponent m -- 3 for n=0.5, 2 for n=1 (5.56's
//     number, reproduced here), 1.5 for n=2 -- and the straight line moves from
//     `1/gap` to `gap^(-1/n)`, whose slope is A_n/n with
//     A_n = (pi R^3 / (tau_0 K^(1/n))) (n/(n+1)) (d/4L)^m / Cc.
//
// Seven starts per index -- `a` 25000 parked, `b`/`c` the two edges parked,
// `d`/`f` one Pa outside, `e`/`g` 2000 Pa outside -- and the three fluids differ
// only in (`flowIndex`, `consistency`) = (0.5, 1.0), (1.0, 0.1), (2.0, 0.02) with
// `tau_0 = 2.0` everywhere. verified by
// tests/check_transient_yield_index_parking_band.py
// (ctest verify.transientYieldIndexParkingBand).
//
// measured over 20001 states: 1312 printed rates from the FIRST decided step
// reproduce this file's HB section integral to 2.874e-07 relative, and the first
// row leaves 1821.0 Pa of the drive (22.8% of 8000, more than either other
// index) to inertia, so the wall starts at 2.04472 Pa instead of 2.49997 -- a
// shear-thickening wall spends more of the drive accelerating the column. The
// bracket reads m = 1.500000 near yield and 1/n = 0.500029 far above; the 34
// trajectory chords span 1.2967 - 1.4999 and the near-edge arms' own chords are
// 1.49985 - 1.49995, 0.010% of m. The straight-line slope is 1.463348e-02,
// 0.011% off A_n/n -- 2.9e4 times the n = 0.5 rate and 30 times the n = 1 rate,
// while the band itself never moved. After 40 s the SAME 2000 Pa start is down to
// 2.774363 Pa, 99.86% of the distance the steep tail barely starts, and the 1 Pa
// start is 0.397901 Pa out. Smallest printed waking rate 7.346240e-12 m3/s.

fluid
{
    rho 850; mu 0.1;
}

nodes
{
    A { fixedPressure 3.0e4; }
    B { fixedPressure 2.0e4; }


    F2a { volume 0.1; bulkModulus 1.0e8; pressure 25000.0; }

    F2b { volume 0.1; bulkModulus 1.0e8; pressure 22000.0; }

    F2c { volume 0.1; bulkModulus 1.0e8; pressure 28000.0; }

    F2d { volume 0.1; bulkModulus 1.0e8; pressure 21999.0; }

    F2e { volume 0.1; bulkModulus 1.0e8; pressure 20000.0; }

    F2f { volume 0.1; bulkModulus 1.0e8; pressure 28001.0; }

    F2g { volume 0.1; bulkModulus 1.0e8; pressure 30000.0; }
}

pipes
{
    S2a { from A; to F2a; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2a { from F2a; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S2b { from A; to F2b; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2b { from F2b; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S2c { from A; to F2c; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2c { from F2c; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S2d { from A; to F2d; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2d { from F2d; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S2e { from A; to F2e; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2e { from F2e; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S2f { from A; to F2f; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2f { from F2f; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S2g { from A; to F2g; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2g { from F2g; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02;
              flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
}

time
{
    dt 0.002; endTime 40.0; reportEvery 1;
}
